        "original_id": "18f9b6f1-0093-56fe-8e5d-66ecfe4f63aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Arts Fuse, Visionaire\n- Products: The Arts Fuse online arts magazine, Visionaire magazine\n- Places: Greater Boston, Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, New York, New England\n- Topics: arts and culture, cultural events, transmedia publishing\n\nFacts:\n- The Arts Fuse is an online arts magazine that covers cultural events in Greater Boston.\n- The Arts Fuse covers cultural events in Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, and New York.\n- The Arts Fuse provides a next-generation platform for arts and culture consumers across New England and beyond.\n- Visionaire is a transmedia company.\n- Visionaire publishes a magazine named Visionaire.\n- Visionaire concepts, curates, and produces art multiples, events, public art installations, film, branded content, apparel, and publications.",
